 {
  "text": "# DeepWiki Available Tools\n\nDeepWiki is an AI-powered documentation and codebase exploration tool. Here are the tools/features typically available:\n\n## 🔍 Core Tools\n\n| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Search** | Search across repositories and documentation |\n| **Ask** | Ask natural language questions about a codebase |\n| **Wiki Generation** | Auto-generate wiki pages from code/repos |\n| **Code Exploration** | Navigate and understand code structure |\n\n## 📡 API / MCP Tools\n\nIf you're referring to **DeepWiki's MCP (Model Context Protocol)** tools:\n\n```\n- search_wiki        → Search DeepWiki content\n- get_page           → Retrieve a specific wiki page\n- list_repositories  → List available repositories\n- ask_question       → Query a repo with natural language\n```\n\n## ⚠️ Note\n\nI don't have real-time access to DeepWiki's current tool catalog. To see **live/accurate tools**:\n\n1. Visit **[deepwiki.com](https://deepwiki.com)**\n2. Check their **API documentation**\n3. Run in an MCP context:\n   ```\n   list_tools()\n   ```\n\n---\n\n**Are you asking about a specific context?**\n- 🔧 MCP integration?\n- 🌐 Web interface features?\n- 📦 API endpoints?\n\nLet me know and I can help further!",
  "type": "text"
 }
],
